        "speaker_label": "ராணி",
        "page_provenance": [
          {"pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": 9}
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "What is it, doctor?",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "raja-rani-en-s001-u006",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "scene_id": "raja-rani-s001",
      "archival_scene_ordinal": 1,
      "source": {
        "source_path": "works/raja-rani/dialogues/records/scene-001.json",
        "canonical_scene_path": "works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-001.md",
        "source_record_id": "raja-rani-s001-d004",
        "source_occurrence_id": null,
        "source_locator": null,
        "speaker_label": "டாக்",
        "page_provenance": [
          {"pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": 9}
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "It's a good thing—your father survived.",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The idiomatic `நல்ல வேலையா` is kept as relief at survival rather than translated literally as `good work`."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "raja-rani-en-s001-u007",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "scene_id": "raja-rani-s001",
      "archival_scene_ordinal": 1,
      "source": {
        "source_path": "works/raja-rani/dialogues/records/scene-001.json",
        "canonical_scene_path": "works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-001.md",
        "source_record_id": "raja-rani-s001-d005",
        "source_occurrence_id": null,
        "source_locator": null,
        "speaker_label": "ராணி",
        "page_provenance": [
          {"pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": 9}
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Many 'thanks', doctor. Is his eyesight all right now?",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The source-visible English-derived `தேங்க்ஸ்` remains visible as `thanks` rather than being replaced by a fully Tamil-register equivalent."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "raja-rani-en-s001-u008",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "scene_id": "raja-rani-s001",
      "archival_scene_ordinal": 1,
      "source": {
        "source_path": "works/raja-rani/dialogues/records/scene-001.json",
        "canonical_scene_path": "works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-001.md",
        "source_record_id": "raja-rani-s001-d006",
        "source_occurrence_id": null,
        "source_locator": null,
        "speaker_label": "டாக்",
        "page_provenance": [
          {"pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": 9}
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Was his accident an ordinary one? That he survived at all is remarkable! Anyway, take him home and make sure he keeps taking the medicine without missing it; we'll see later!",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The doctor's rhetorical question and colloquial instruction are retained rather than compressed into clinical prose."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "raja-rani-en-s001-u009",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "scene_id": "raja-rani-s001",
      "archival_scene_ordinal": 1,
      "source": {
        "source_path": "works/raja-rani/dialogues/records/scene-001.json",
        "canonical_scene_path": "works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-001.md",
        "source_record_id": "raja-rani-s001-d007",
        "source_occurrence_id": null,
        "source_locator": null,
        "speaker_label": "ராணி",
        "page_provenance": [
          {"pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": 9}
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Then... his eyes...?",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The broken, hesitant source wording `அப்படின்னு... அவங்கண்...?` is left fragmentary rather than completed into a smoother question."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "raja-rani-en-s001-u010",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "scene_id": "raja-rani-s001",
      "archival_scene_ordinal": 1,
      "source": {
        "source_path": "works/raja-rani/dialogues/records/scene-001.json",
        "canonical_scene_path": "works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-001.md",
        "source_record_id": "raja-rani-s001-d008",
        "source_occurrence_id": null,
        "source_locator": null,
        "speaker_label": "டாக்",
        "page_provenance": [
          {"pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": 9}
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "I told you well beforehand even then, amma—he has grown old. Whether his eyesight will return now is doubtful!",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The source's repeated beforehand/already emphasis is retained rather than streamlined away.",
          "`amma` preserves the doctor's familiar address to Rani without implying kinship."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "raja-rani-en-s001-u011",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
